    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "Now, any more questions?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_367_swllow_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_066",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat",
        "text": "Just to be sure, how did you identify the eight corpses, Officer Severin?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_367_swllow_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_066",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "Body type, sex, approximate age, a list of the town's missing persons."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "But now is not the time to discuss the fire. We have more pressing issues at hand."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_367_swllow_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_066",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat",
        "text": "I don't disagree, but..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_345_folnic_1#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Folinic",
        "text": "What have you got?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
            "name2": "char_367_swllow_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat",
        "text": "The number of Infected people who lost their lives in the fire was 'four,' according to the Reunion member we spoke to."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_367_swllow_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_066",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "Is there a reason we should care what the enemy has to say?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_367_swllow_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_066",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat",
        "text": "With all due respect, this does matter. 'Caring' what he says is different from 'trusting' it. We have a major risk of misunderstanding here."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_367_swllow_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_066",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "I still don't think this will solve the problem. Uncovering the truth about the fire will not improve our situation."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
            "name2": "avg_npc_066",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Folinic",
        "text": "It means a lot to me."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
            "name2": "avg_npc_066",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "Then, with all due respect, Miss Folinic, you've been letting your emotions pull you around too much."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
            "name2": "avg_npc_066",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Folinic",
        "text": "But you must\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
            "name2": "avg_npc_066",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "I fight for Wolumonde and Wolumonde alone. That is my duty. I'm not here to serve the justice in your heart."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "I have a responsibility to give the truth to Rhodes Island, not your thirst for revenge."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
            "name2": "avg_npc_066",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Folinic",
        "text": "You\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_345_folnic_1#2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Folinic",
        "text": "\u2014No, you're right..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Folinic",
        "text": "I need to go calm down... I, I'll go help Lisa with the wounded."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
