    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "Then it's settled. Our top priority is to retake Zw\u00f6lftontechnik Strasse."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "War is inevitable, at this point. Rhodes Island will need to focus on the fight for the automated Arts units, all while keeping a close eye on the Sarkaz and other partisans."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "Direct crowd control will be on us. The most difficult jobs, we give to you."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_294_ayer",
            "name2": "avg_npc_066",
            "focus": 1
        }
