    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_294_ayer",
            "name2": "avg_npc_066",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "Erm, did I say too much?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_367_swllow_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_066",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat",
        "text": "No. Tell me, what did you see in their eyes? The insurgents, and the angry townspeople."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat",
        "text": "If they managed to overwhelm us, that would be the end of the town of Wolumonde."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat",
        "text": "And regardless of what the truth may be, headlines around the world would read 'Reunion resurfaces and destroys a town in Leithanien.'"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat",
        "text": "After so many sacrifices, so many goodbyes, I did not want to see it happen again."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_367_swllow_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat",
        "text": "Ayerscarpe, contact Click. It's time to regroup."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat",
        "text": "I'm going to check on the Infected captives."
    },
