    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Infected Captive",
        "text": "No, it's not about fighting. Without Arts, I can't even use my refrigerator!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_358_lisa_1#2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran",
        "text": "You just use it normally, through the device. Don't irritate the Originium in your body. That way, you don't worsen your infection!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_067"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Infected Captive",
        "text": "...I cheaped out and bought a second-hand one that needs a caster to operate..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_358_lisa_1#2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran",
        "text": "No!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_067"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Infected Captive",
        "text": "Y-you're an outsider! What do you know? Will I ever get to lead a normal life? With what we're fighting against, we\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_358_lisa_1#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran",
        "text": "Okay, okay. Just remember to take care of yourself so you don't get worse. You're still pretty healthy. And no more using Arts!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_067"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Infected Captive",
        "text": "We're fighting against... Never mind. What can I say to a child...?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_358_lisa_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran",
        "text": "All right. Next up..."
    },
    {
        "command": "stopmusic",
        "params": {
            "fadetime": 3
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran",
        "text": "Oh, an old man? What's he doing here at his age...?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Man",
        "text": "Heh heh. A nine-tailed Vulpo. That's something you don't see every day."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Man",
        "text": "Hm. That reminds me. I've been hearing a lot of talk of Winterwisps and outlanders. Would that be you?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran",
        "text": "Oh, yes. Can you tell me where you're hurt?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Man",
        "text": "Hm? Oh, I'm not hurt. I'm just here to wait for death. I'm old, and getting sleepy..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran",
        "text": "D-death? Let's not get too morbid here..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "stopmusic",
        "params": {
            "fadetime": 3
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Man",
        "text": "Child, I'm a Winterwisp. Last of the Winterwisp clansmen, in fact."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran",
        "text": "What?!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Man",
        "text": "Heh heh. You're awfully cute when you're shocked, child... And, I sense no hostility from you."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran",
        "text": "The last...? But everyone's been saying the Winterwisps are helping the Infected rebels."
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Man",
        "text": "*Sigh*. It's only when they're so filled with hate that they think of their heritage. And that heritage is just an excuse. They hate something else altogether."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Man",
        "text": "Would you indulge an old man for a minute? I'm already your prisoner, after all. I'm not going to do anything... ever again. I'm too old."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran",
        "text": "Oh, um... As old as you are, I should treat you. Even if it's just a flesh wound."
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Man",
        "text": "Hah hah. I'm still pretty strong, in my old age... No, no. That's a lie."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Man",
        "text": "My clansmen mostly went elsewhere. Or they intermarried with the people of Wolumonde."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Man",
        "text": "In the end, how many real Winterwisps are left? Just a few of us old fogies."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran",
        "text": "Sir... what did you do?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Man",
        "text": "I... killed. Many people."
    },
    {
        "command": "playmusic",
        "params": {
            "intro": "$storyendjp_intro",
            "key": "$storyendjp_loop",
            "volume": 0.4
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Man",
        "text": "A traveling merchant who came to Wolumonde, a noble who dared to wander into the wilds... and so many more."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Man",
        "text": "At first we thought it was justified. Proper vengeance..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Man",
        "text": "So the old-timers did all the hard work. The younger ones just stood by. None of it meant anything to their lives anymore."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Man",
        "text": "But vengeance. We couldn't kill the traitors. We couldn't kill the rotten nobles. It turns out, we could only unleash our hatred on so many innocents."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Man",
        "text": "We couldn't defeat Leithanien. Not its laws, not the mighty roar of the engines of its nomadic cities."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Man",
        "text": "We started giving up. I escaped into Wolumonde, and Severin picked off the other old clansmen one by one. He's a hunter. Never wavers."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Man",
        "text": "But they say he'll sit with a dying enemy and have one last smoke with him. Too bad today's manufactured cigarettes are awful."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Man",
        "text": "As for me, I built myself a nest out of scavenged tin, underneath Wolumonde. Severin didn't get the last one, in the end."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Man",
        "text": "Am I afraid to die? Nay. Believe me, little Vulpo girl, I'm not afraid."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Man",
        "text": "I just want to hear the sound of a town's power plant roaring to life, after my own lifetime of fruitless revenge."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Man",
        "text": "Maybe someday Wolumonde will grow into a nomadic city, or maybe it'll die out."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Man",
        "text": "But... Hah... I'm a Winterwisp. Was I furious the first time I saw that boiler heat up and send the town crawling away? Yes, but what could I do? I remember it. I just cried."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Man",
        "text": "It surged, it scorched, it singed, unstoppable. What could I do with only my bow and a short sword? I fell in love with it... with this murder weapon..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Man",
        "text": "But Biederman did it, treacherous boy. A Catastrophe Messenger, and an outsider, did what I'd never dare to do in my entire life..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_358_lisa_1#2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran",
        "text": "S-slow down, sir! Th-that Biederman you're talking about..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran",
        "text": "I remember a Catastrophe Messenger in Leithanien by that name, but I think he died in the fire?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Man",
        "text": "Hm? I'm not sure about that. He's the one giving the orders."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran",
        "text": "So that means...?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Man",
        "text": "Do you know that feeling of powerlessness?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran",
        "text": "Huh?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Man",
        "text": "When I watched Biederman... take the Infected, the Arts, the destruction... When I watched him ruin the power plant, I was completely powerless..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Man",
        "text": "It turns out the thing that conquered us all those years ago was just a big hunk of iron... How weary I've become."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Man",
        "text": "...Are you still there?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran",
        "text": "Yes, I'm listening."
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Man",
        "text": "Don't rush to revenge. Don't fight. Listen to me, girl."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Man",
        "text": "The Winterwisps aren't the reason for all this... At least, not anymore."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Man",
        "text": "How many here in Wolumonde have the Winterwisp blood in their veins? We were the ones who built this place in the beginning."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Man",
        "text": "Winterwisp, Winterwisp is Wolumonde... It's the moon... And they, they destroyed themselves..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran",
        "text": "So that's the story."
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Man",
        "text": "Look, little Vulpo girl, do you see where the road leads?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran",
        "text": "Up ahead? It's an ordinary road. It leads to the town hall."
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Man",
        "text": "No..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Man",
        "text": "It leads to the mountains."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Man",
        "text": "The long banner flies... twelve twists and turns in the trail... travelers and blowing snow... ah... the power plant..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Man",
        "text": "Ahh... ..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_358_lisa_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran",
        "text": "Right. I forgot."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran",
        "text": "That is the way to the mountains."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran",
        "text": "Good night."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 2
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
            "fadetime": 1,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Folinic",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3",
            "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran",
        "text": "Did you hear that, Folinic?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran",
        "text": "We've been going in circles."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3",
            "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Folinic",
        "text": "A Catastrophe Messenger thought dead is actually leading the mob?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Folinic",
        "text": "Biederman, huh...?"
    },
